+{"fact":{"at":"2026-09-28T15:44:39-05:00","id":"screenshots-at-1280-1920-3440-are-requir","text":"Screenshots at 1280, 1920, 3440 are required ONLY for a 'full' size review: when a new page, module, tool, or Servex change exists. Light (code, no new page) and none (CSS/docs ≤20 lines) skip screenshots.","certainty":"settled"}}
