+{"fact":{"at":"2026-09-28T15:28:00-05:00","id":"when-a-module-opens-a-new-namespace-its-","text":"When a module opens a new namespace, its first class must add one line to css-scopes.txt ('prefix-   owner'); if css-scopes.txt is outside your write fence, the reservation is still owed — write it into the module's own doc/decisions.md under Open instead of dropping it.","certainty":"settled"}}
+{"fact":{"at":"2026-09-28T15:28:00-05:00","id":"before-naming-a-card-tile-box-class-chec","text":"Before naming a '-card'/'-tile'/'-box' class, check it isn't just the framework's existing '.card' (a framed box) — the three spacing words are '.pad' for a page region, '.card' for a framed box, and an em unit for a control or row; ~180 hand-rolled duplicate card/tile classes existed sitewide before this was enforced.","certainty":"likely"}}
