++{"fact":{"at":"2026-09-28T15:28:00-05:00","id":"always-census-the-live-css-with-grep-bef","text":"Always census the live CSS with grep before naming: grep -rhoE '\\.<name>[a-z0-9-]*' public --include=*.css --include=*.js. A hit elsewhere is a collision and vetos the name.","certainty":"settled"}}
++{"fact":{"at":"2026-09-28T15:28:00-05:00","id":"always-prefix-with-the-owning-module-e-g","text":"Always prefix with the owning module (e.g., .panel-grip, not .grip) unless the selector already starts with the module's own class. This is the core collision-avoidance mechanism.","certainty":"settled"}}
