++{"fact":{"at":"2026-09-28T15:28:00-05:00","id":"when-opening-a-new-namespace-a-module-s-","text":"When opening a new namespace (a module's first class), add its prefix to css-scopes.txt. If you cannot write css-scopes.txt, record the reservation in the module's own doc/decisions.md under Open.","certainty":"likely"}}
