++{"fact":{"at":"2026-09-28T15:28:00-05:00","id":"view-subclasses-automatically-mint-css-c","text":"View subclasses automatically mint CSS class names via View.classify() — a class Stage becomes .stage, LayoutsPair becomes .layouts-pair; these minted names must be prefixed like any declared class (PagingStage → .paging-stage)","certainty":"settled"}}
